
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>StreamLore | AI Clipper</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
  background: #090b10;
  color: #f4f5f8;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; }
header {
  height: 76px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #20232d;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 0 6%;
}
.logo { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; }
.logo span { color: #a78bfa; }
.status { color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; }
main { max-width: 1050px; margin: 65px auto; padding: 0 24px; }
.eyebrow { color: #a78bfa; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); margin: 12px 0; }
.subtitle { color: #9298a8; line-height: 1.7; }
.panel {
  background: #11141d;
  border: 1px solid #252938;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 28px;
  margin-top: 35px;
}
h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
.hint { color: #9298a8; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
label { display: block; font-size: 13px; margin: 18px 0 9px; }
input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 15px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  border: 1px solid #303647;
  background: #090b10;
  color: white;
  font-size: 14px;
}
input:focus { outline: 1px solid #a78bfa; }
button {
  margin-top: 22px;
  background: #8b5cf6;
  color: white;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 9px;
  padding: 14px 22px;
  font-weight: 700;
  cursor: pointer;
}
button:hover { background: #7c3aed; }
.notice {
  margin-top: 18px;
  padding: 13px;
  background: #1b1b2a;
  border-radius: 8px;
  color: #b9b4d3;
  font-size: 13px;
}
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 14px;
  margin-top: 20px;
}
.stat {
  background: #11141d;
  border: 1px solid #252938;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px;
}
.stat strong { display: block; font-size: 23px; margin-bottom: 7px; }
.stat span { color: #9298a8; font-size: 12px; }
footer { color: #666d7d; text-align: center; padding: 40px; font-size: 12px; }
@media(max-width:650px) {
  .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  main { margin-top: 40px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">STREAM<span>LORE</span></div>
  <div class="status">● Cloud workspace</div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="eyebrow">GTA VI CONTENT STUDIO</div>
  <h1>Turn streams into<br>viral-worthy moments.</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">
    Find the best moments from GTA VI streamers,
    analyze highlights with AI, and create vertical clips.
  </p>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Start a new project</h2>
    <p class="hint">Submit a public stream recording or upload a video.</p>

    <form id="projectForm">
      <label for="vodUrl">Stream or VOD URL</label>
      <input id="vodUrl" type="url"
        placeholder="Paste a YouTube, Twitch or Kick URL">

      <label for="videoFile">Or upload an MP4 video</label>
      <input id="videoFile" type="file" accept="video/mp4">

      <button type="submit">Prepare my project →</button>
    </form>

    <div class="notice" id="message">
      Project processing is being configured. Your videos
      will be processed in the cloud, not on your Mac.
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="stat">
      <strong>AI</strong>
      <span>Highlight detection</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <strong>9:16</strong>
      <span>Vertical video output</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <strong>1080p</strong>
      <span>Target export quality</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>STREAMLORE © 2026 · GTA VI CLIPPING STUDIO</footer>

<script>
document.getElementById("projectForm").addEventListener("submit", function(event) {
  event.preventDefault();
  document.getElementById("message").textContent =
    "Dashboard ready. Cloud processing and project submission will be connected in the next development steps.";
});
</script>

</body>
</html>
